{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bomb Around\u00a0...and find out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is a platforming challenge where you play as a bomb whose sole purpose is to reach as high as possible. This is an explosive journey to compete in 3 different game modes: SpeedRun, Daily Seed and Regular play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explode your way to the top.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but be careful, the more you explode, the less platforms there are to catch you when you fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charge your explosion for bigger jumps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This simple to learn, hard to master mechanic, combined with the freedom to aim with your mouse will surely challenge you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Unique upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up upgrades on your journey that will aid you\u00a0in reaching new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/upgrades2x2.gif?t=1744466045\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>3 Different GameModes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Normal: for those who want to explore and have fun without extra pressure, but still a chance for recognition via the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> SpeeRun: try to reach a certain height as quickly as possible to get a place on the leaderboard. (seed based)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Daily seed: compete to reach as high as possible in a mode that changes seed once every 24hr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tutorial World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/TutorialWorld.gif?t=1744466045\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good place to learn how to learn how the game works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dress up your character as you go:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops to customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/cosmeticShop.gif?t=1744466045\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your favorite character skin as you get more money:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also many different bomb types you can choose between!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/extras/characterShop.gif?t=1744466045\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100m Certificate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/99de27e9cc7aec573b7b8c591067cc1ca5b05640.jpg"},{"name":"200m Certificate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/8ec6fb79c394cfe556f71010e80a2395a467bee3.jpg"},{"name":"300m Certificate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/7520b363abbccb4488c4b324181c7ed5ccad4164.jpg"},{"name":"400m Certificate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/ba084ae6a8e85551c3377940bd5cc159742e26a1.jpg"},{"name":"500m Certificate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/372cda0c842339e5189110c96e1467e4d2bda08a.jpg"},{"name":"Non-Exclusivity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/7585373cf3b2e149543afb98548d0b6fb7a9819d.jpg"},{"name":"Daily master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/f345477bc7c5d88da944ac6d45f14d10382ba0fd.jpg"},{"name":"SpeedRun Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3539690/dac50e37def64b25aa4b4a351286a677bdc25467.jpg"},{"name":"Multiupgrade user","path":"h